  "qualification": {
    "category": "not a fit",
    "rationale": "North Star Kitchen and Bath Remodels operates as a residential kitchen and bathroom remodeling design-build contractor and general contractor. It falls outside ForgeX's defined target segment of owner-led HVAC, plumbing, and electrical service contractors with 10 to 75 staff who pay for service leads. In addition, the company already uses a third-party CRM survey widget (msgsndr.com) for inbound lead capture, and the website provides no evidence of meeting the 10-75 staff threshold. No outreach draft is generated."
  }
